Package: rummage
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, shared-mime-info, hicolor-icon-theme,
 libheif1 (>= 1.23), libheif-plugin-libde265 (>= 1.23)
Suggests: rummage-previews, rummage-media, rummage-pdf, tokei
Description: Native Wayland file manager
 A file manager with column and grid views, isolated previews, configurable
 custom actions and an optional desktop file chooser portal.

Package: rummage-media
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, rummage (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Optional video thumbnails and still previews for rummage
 Isolated video decoding using system FFmpeg shared libraries. No FFmpeg
 command-line tools are required. This package does not provide playback.

Package: rummage-pdf
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, rummage (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Optional PDF thumbnails and first-page previews for rummage
 Isolated PDF rendering with a private, source-built PDFium library.
 This package provides still previews, not a document viewer.

Package: rummage-previews
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, rummage-media (= ${binary:Version}), rummage-pdf (= ${binary:Version})
Description: All optional preview engines for rummage
 Convenience package installing video and PDF preview helpers.
